                <div class="card-body text-center">
                    <h3 class="color-theme">Our Impact</h3>
                    <p>We've served over 1 million meals to needy families across the country, making a real difference in their lives.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/66/ee/2a/66ee2ada8f35ca1a2efa86bf1ef84d65.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="Our Volunteers">
                <div class="card-body text-center">
